claims:
42. A system, comprising:
at least one processor; and a storage device in data communication with the at least one processor and storing:
a statistics collection engine that upon execution by a processor obtains query statistics for a plurality of search queries, the query statistics for each search query including a query search volume value corresponding to the search query, the query search volume value being computed based on a number of times that the search query has been received;
a statistics analysis engine that upon execution by a processor groups the search queries into groups of queries, each group of queries corresponding to a topic for which the search queries are identified as relevant, and each group of queries having a corresponding topic corpus that includes documents identified as responsive to the search queries grouped to the topic;
a comparator that upon execution by a processor identifies an underserved topic based on a function of topic corpus quality measures and query statistics for the groups of queries that correspond to the topics, the topic corpus quality measure for each group of queries being computed based on a measure of relevance of the topic corpus to the corresponding topic; and
a topic distribution engine that upon execution and in response to receiving the search query corresponding to an underserved topic provides data that causes presentation of a notification that the search query corresponds to an underserved topic.
